---
// src/components/mbkm/detail/DetailFaq.astro
---

<!-- ==================== FAQ ==================== -->
<section id="faq" class="relative isolate scroll-mt-6 overflow-x-clip pt-10 pb-16 sm:pt-14 sm:pb-20 lg:pt-16 lg:pb-24 bg-slate-50/70">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 top-0 -z-10 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-blue-50 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="split-badge mb-4">
        <span class="split-badge-left">FAQ</span>
        <span class="split-badge-right">TANYA JAWAB</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#072f57] sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">Pertanyaan Yang Sering Diajukan</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 sm:text-base">Temukan jawaban seputar persyaratan, dokumen, dan proses konversi sebelum kamu mengajukan pendaftaran Dicoding ASAH 2026.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-3.5 sm:mt-12">
      <!-- 1 (terbuka default) -->
      <details name="faq" open class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white shadow-xs transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#072f57] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 group-open:bg-[#072f57] group-open:text-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span>Apa saja syarat akademik untuk mendaftar?</span>
          <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#f59e0b] transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 bg-white">
          Sistem memvalidasi data akademikmu secara otomatis. Kriteria umum mencakup IPK minimal 3,00, minimal semester 5 (atau sesuai ketentuan program), dan minimal 80 SKS tempuh. Ketentuan khusus, termasuk riwayat cuti, mengikuti aturan program yang berlaku.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 2 -->
      <details name="faq" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white shadow-xs transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#072f57] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 group-open:bg-[#072f57] group-open:text-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span>Dokumen apa yang perlu disiapkan?</span>
          <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#f59e0b] transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 bg-white">
          Siapkan satu tautan Google Drive yang memuat CV ATS dalam format PDF, portofolio karya, serta sertifikat atau bukti pengalaman. Pastikan tautan dapat diakses oleh pihak yang memeriksa, dan data semester, IPK, serta SKS di sistem akademik sudah sesuai.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <details name="faq" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white shadow-xs transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#072f57] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 group-open:bg-[#072f57] group-open:text-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span>Berapa SKS yang bisa dikonversi?</span>
          <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#f59e0b] transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 bg-white">
          Program ini dapat dikonversi hingga maksimal 20 SKS. Pelajari hak dan kewajiban program, lalu siapkan draf usulan mata kuliah konversi sebelum mengajukan pendaftaran.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 4 -->
      <details name="faq" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white shadow-xs transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#072f57] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 group-open:bg-[#072f57] group-open:text-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span>Apa perbedaan Asistensi, Proyek, dan Riset/Publikasi?</span>
          <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#f59e0b] transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 bg-white">
          Asistensi berfokus pada pendampingan dan pelaksanaan tugas, Proyek pada pengembangan solusi atau produk, sedangkan Riset/Publikasi pada penelitian terstruktur hingga publikasi hasil. Detailnya bisa kamu lihat pada bagian Kegiatan Program di atas.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 5 -->
      <details name="faq" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white shadow-xs transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#072f57] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 group-open:bg-[#072f57] group-open:text-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span>Apakah Showcase termasuk proses pendaftaran?</span>
          <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#f59e0b] transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 bg-white">
          Tidak. Showcase adalah informasi publik untuk menampilkan karya, proyek, atau hasil penelitian mahasiswa, dan bukan bagian dari proses pengajuan pendaftaran.
        </div>
      </details>

      <!-- 6 -->
      <details name="faq" class="group overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-white shadow-xs transition-colors">
        <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 py-4.5 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#072f57] transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50 group-open:bg-[#072f57] group-open:text-white [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
          <span>Bagaimana jika persyaratanku belum terpenuhi?</span>
          <i data-lucide="chevron-down" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#f59e0b] transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180"></i>
        </summary>
        <div class="faq-answer px-6 pb-6 pt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 bg-white">
          Mahasiswa yang belum memenuhi persyaratan tidak dapat melanjutkan ke tahap pendaftaran berikutnya. Periksa kembali data akademikmu atau hubungi pihak fakultas untuk informasi lebih lanjut.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @keyframes faq-fade {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  details[open] > .faq-answer { animation: faq-fade 0.25s ease; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    details[open] > .faq-answer { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
